{"id":675,"name":"pangoro","speciesId":675,"dex":675,"form":"normal","generation":6,"types":["fighting","dark"],"stats":{"hp":95,"attack":124,"defense":78,"special-attack":69,"special-defense":71,"speed":58},"abilities":[{"name":"iron-fist","hidden":false},{"name":"mold-breaker","hidden":false},{"name":"scrappy","hidden":true}],"height":21,"weight":1360,"baseExp":173,"sprites":{"normal":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/675.png","shiny":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/shiny/675.png","icon":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/675.png"},"cry":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/675.ogg","genus":"Daunting Pokémon","flavor":[{"version":"x","text":"Although it possesses a violent temperament, it won’t put up with bullying. It uses the leaf in its mouth to sense the movements of its enemies."},{"version":"y","text":"It charges ahead and bashes its opponents like a berserker, uncaring about any hits it might take. Its arms are mighty enough to snap a telephone pole."},{"version":"sun","text":"It boasts superb physical strength. Those who wish to become Pangoro’s Trainer have no choice but to converse with their fists."},{"version":"moon","text":"From the slight twitches of its bamboo leaf, it deduces its opponent’s movements. It’s eager to tussle but kindhearted toward its companions."},{"version":"ultra-sun","text":"This rowdy Pokémon boasts great physical strength. Many Trainers are also smitten by its lively character."},{"version":"ultra-moon","text":"Pangoro is the type to talk with its fists. It doesn’t say much as it pummels opponents with enough force to send a dump truck flying."},{"version":"sword","text":"This Pokémon is quick to anger, and it has no problem using its prodigious strength to get its way. It lives for duels against Obstagoon."},{"version":"shield","text":"Using its leaf, Pangoro can predict the moves of its opponents. It strikes with punches that can turn a dump truck into scrap with just one hit."}],"genderRate":4,"captureRate":65,"eggGroups":["ground","humanshape"],"isLegendary":false,"isMythical":false,"evolution":{"species":"pancham","speciesId":674,"evolvesTo":[{"conditions":["Nível 32, Com Pokémon de tipo dark na equipe"],"species":"pangoro","speciesId":675,"evolvesTo":[]}]},"varieties":[{"id":675,"name":"pangoro","form":"normal","sprite":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/675.png"}],"games":[15,16,17,18,20],"moves":[{"id":2,"learn":[[15,"lv",12],[16,"lv",12],[17,"lv",12],[18,"lv",12]]},{"id":4,"learn":[[15,"lv",15],[16,"lv",15],[17,"lv",15],[18,"lv",15]]},{"id":5,"learn":[[20,"tm",0]]},{"id":7,"learn":[[16,"tutor",0],[18,"tutor",0],[20,"tm",0]]},{"id":8,"learn":[[16,"tutor",0],[18,"tutor",0],[20,"tm",0]]},{"id":9,"learn":[[16,"tutor",0],[18,"tutor",0],[20,"tm",0]]},{"id":14,"learn":[[15,"tm",0],[16,"tm",0],[17,"tm",0],[18,"tm",0],[20,"tm",0]]},{"id":15,"learn":[[15,"tm",0],[16,"tm",0]]},{"id":25,"learn":[[20,"tm",0]]},{"id":33,"learn":[[15,"lv",1],[16,"lv",1],[17,"lv",1],[18,"lv",1],[20,"lv",1]]},{"id":34,"learn":[[15,"lv",35],[16,"lv",35],[17,"lv",35],[18,"lv",35],[20,"lv",40],[20,"tm",0]]},{"id":43,"learn":[[15,"lv",1],[16,"lv",1],[17,"lv",1],[18,"lv",1],[20,"lv",1]]},{"id":46,"learn":[[15,"tm",0],[16,"tm",0],[17,"tm",0],[18,"tm",0]]},{"id":57,"learn":[[15,"tm",0],[16,"tm",0],[17,"tm",0],[18,"tm",0],[20,"tm",0]]},{"id":63,"learn":[[15,"tm",0],[16,"tm",0],[17,"tm",0],[18,"tm",0],[20,"tm",0]]},{"id":67,"learn":[[16,"tutor",0],[18,"tutor",0],[20,"tm",0]]},{"id":70,"learn":[[15,"tm",0],[16,"tm",0]]},{"id":89,"learn":[[15,"tm",0],[16,"tm",0],[17,"tm",0],[18,"tm",0],[20,"tm",0]]},{"id":91,"learn":[[15,"tm",0],[16,"tm",0],[20,"tm",0]]},{"id":92,"learn":[[15,"tm",0],[16,"tm",0],[17,"tm",0],[18,"tm",0]]},{"id":104,"learn":[[15,"tm",0],[16,"tm",0]